flowchart TD
    Decision[Existing own Rifle decision] --> Context[Existing urgency and collection context]
    Context --> Survival[Existing threat and final withdrawal results]
    Survival --> Latest[Replace one last-assessed scalar diagnostic]
    Survival --> Collection[Unchanged collection decision and physical owners]
    Latest --> Accessor[Detached read guarded by current intent parent and owner]
    Accessor --> Projection[Existing recipient projection once per reported squad]
    Collection --> Present{Actual collection exists?}
    Present -->|yes| Actual[Show actual collection state]
    Present -->|no| Projection
    Projection --> Detail[Last supply pickup check at time and recorded reason]
    Accessor -->|new operation not assessed| Unknown[Supply pickup has not been checked for this operation yet]
